Dear Admissions Office,

I hope this email finds you well. My name is Patrio Gabriel A. Patdu, and I
am writing to bring to your attention some deficiencies that I have
identified in my college application.

I kindly request that you consider these updates as part of my overall
application. Please let me know if any further documentation or
clarification is required from my end. I am more than willing to provide
any additional information necessary to complete my application file.

I appreciate your time and attention to this matter. Thank you for your
understanding, and I look forward to the opportunity to further discuss my
application.

Best Regards,

Patrio Gabriel A. Patdu

